Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add a network traffic monitor to the status bar
 [1/2]

Show how fast data moves, down and up together, next to the status icons
while Settings.Secure network_traffic_enabled is on. It refreshes every
second, hides below 1 KB/s, stops counting while the screen is off and
follows the status bar tint like the clock.

